<h2>Who walks the floor</h2>

<p>Buyers, importers and distributors from China and across the region. Kenyan
growers, factories and exporters. Investors, regulators, logistics operators
and trade-service providers.</p>

<p>The Secretariat publishes the registration breakdown as registrations build,
so exhibitors can see the audience before committing.</p>

<h2>Why take a stand</h2>

<p>A stand puts a product in front of buyers who had no meeting booked. The
expo runs on the third day, with the full delegation on site, which
concentrates footfall into a single trading day.</p>

